# Research handoff: 128 MB of raw OpenStreetMap extracts. The scripts, notices
# and logs are provenance and get committed; the bulk dumps do not. What the
# site actually serves is the compact index built from them, which lives in
# public/data/ and is small enough to version.
/Karachify Research/_raw/
/Karachify Research/_repo/
/Karachify Research/scripts/_*
/Karachify Research/data/by-category/
/Karachify Research/data/top/
/Karachify Research/data/karachify-dataset.json
/Karachify Research/data/karachify-dataset.min.json
/Karachify Research/data/karachify-listings.csv
/Karachify Research/data/unverified.json
/Karachify Research/data/duplicates.json
